{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43592","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 长乐坊安国寺 红楼联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 长乐坊安国寺 红楼联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重叠碎晴空，余霞更照红。\n蝉踪近鳷鹊，鸟道接相风。\n苔静金轮路，云轻白日宫。\n壁诗传谢客，门牓占休公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}